152 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 76 0 R
/E (While cultural diversity is widely recognised as an important value, international law maintains that cultural practices cannot justify violations of fundamental human rights. The debate therefore centres not on whether culture deserves respect, but on the extent to which it may influence the implementation of internationally recognised rights. )
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [10]
>>
endobj
153 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /Figure
/P 76 0 R
/Pg 15 0 R
/A [467 0 R 0]
